   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Raw Feel [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-05-26.dankski** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 15 songs; 117 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-26**: source not stated; 15 songs; 117 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-05-26.dankski**: taped by DankskiVision; transferred by Teddy Dunski; source: Zoom Matrix 24/48 [1]\n- **kglw2024-05-26**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: AT 4041 > PMD661 > wav [2]. Also: Recorded with AT4041 and PMD611 Oade mod at 24/96, converted to FLAC; FOB position in right front corner, 8.5 feet from stage; Mics lent by chocobot; mix and stand protection by Sammy [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Liverpool Olympia Liverpool UK May 26 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-liverpool-olympia-liverpool-uk-may-26-2024-poster) [4]\n- Fan art by @swaycout: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Liverpool Olympia Liverpool UK May 26 2024 Poster](https://swaycout.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-liverpool-olympia-liverpool-uk-may-26-2024-poster/) [5]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For The Show At Liverpool Olympia In Liverpool UK On May 26th 2024 Home Decor ](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-the-show-at-liverpool-olympia-in-liverpool-uk-on-may-26th-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [6]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For The Show At Liverpool Olympia In Liverpool UK On May 26th 2024 All Over Pr](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-the-show-at-liverpool-olympia-in-liverpool-uk-on-may-26th-2024-all-over-print-shirt/) [7]\n- Poster by fanateeco: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard May 26 2024 Liverpool Olympia Liverpool UK shirt](https://fanateeco.blogspot.com/2024/05/king-gizzard-and-lizard-wizard-may-26.html) [8]\n- Fan art by Fanateeco: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard May 26 2024 Liverpool Olympia Liverpool UK shirt, hoodie, sweater, long sleeve and ta](https://fanateeco.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-may-26-2024-liverpool-olympia-liverpool-uk-shirt/) [9]",
